However, if you do this, `calculateBlockSizes(nodes,`, `insertBlocks(nodes,`, and `insertEdges(nodes,` will all throw TypeScript errors, since even though their types say that they're accepting `ContainerElement`, they lie. They actually only accept `Selection<ContainerElement>`!

